        "brief": "Make a linear barcode on an unbranded package the dominant feature, large enough that separate bars and spaces remain clear on a phone. Use a quiet package edge only for context. No price text, real customer identifier, or claim that the pictured code is a licensed or usable product code; reject a scanner or price-tag image as the main subject.",
        "picture_suitable": true,
        "available_animations": [],
        "adaptations": [
          "Change only source SVG viewBox from 0 0 300 300 to 92 79 173 88, retaining every original bar and space. The narrow border is cropped at its edge; no barcode strokes are fabricated.",
          "Rasterize this source crop at 692 by 352, then apply it as a planar artwork surface on the unchanged complete Kenney parcel.",
          "Use recorded camera and lighting with an intentional package-edge close-up; preserve all original parcel nodes, geometry, materials, texture and child transforms.",
          "Downscale the 768 by 440 rendered composition proportionally to 512 by 293."
        ]
      },
