        "brief": "Show a clean wooden goods pallet in a low three-quarter view so top slats, spacer blocks, and fork-entry gaps are visible. One small carton may show scale without obscuring the platform. Reject a pile of boards, a bed, or a loaded pallet hidden entirely by boxes. A weathered source asset is not automatically compatible with the clean Retail art direction.",
